'''Hattori Hanzo''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. He was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] increases health, damage and freeze duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

