==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Hattori Hanzō|Hattori Hanzō]] was a famous samurai and ninja from the [[wikipedia:Sengoku period|Sengoku era]]. In fiction, he is often portrayed as a rival to [[wikipedia:Fūma Kotarō|Fūma Kotarō]].
*An ''[[wikipedia:Iaitō|iaitō]]'' is a sword used to practice ''[[wikipedia:Iaido|iaidō]]'', a martial art based around drawing the sword and striking extremely quickly.
*Prior to [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]], Hattori Hanzo's descriptions did not mention his Colossus Slayer.
*In [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]], data for Hattori Hanzo's [[True Form]] was added to the code, but not fully released. Alongside general stat increases, this True Form would swap out Hattori Hanzo's [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] target for [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]].

